<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Vinofilo</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/</link><description>Vinofilo：意大利葡萄酒的故事、产区与工艺。品种、产区、酿造与侍酒，有观点地讲述。</description><language>zh</language><atom:link href="https://vinofilo.com/zh/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hostaria 2026：步行喝遍维罗纳，从布拉广场到领主广场</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.07/hostaria-2026-weiluona-buxing-pin-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.07/hostaria-2026-weiluona-buxing-pin-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>10月16日至18日，Hostaria把维罗纳老城变成露天酒窖：索阿维、卡斯托扎、巴多利诺与加尔达，就在广场和庭院之间。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/hostaria-verona-2026.jpg?v=2220be28" length="282292" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/hostaria-verona-2026.jpg?v=2220be28" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>阿尔巴白松露2026：松露节的周末该喝什么</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.07/aerba-baisonglu-2026-songlujie-zhoumo-he-shenme/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.07/aerba-baisonglu-2026-songlujie-zhoumo-he-shenme/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>10月10日至12月6日，阿尔巴举办第96届白松露节：节日的历史、节目安排，以及这些周末值得开的朗格葡萄酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fiera-tartufo-bianco-alba-2026.jpg?v=fe562d85" length="246445" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fiera-tartufo-bianco-alba-2026.jpg?v=fe562d85" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2027年葡萄酒指南：目前的获奖名单，以及各家的共识</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.07/2027-putaojiu-zhinan-huojiang-mingdan-gongshi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.07/2027-putaojiu-zhinan-huojiang-mingdan-gongshi/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>Bibenda、Winemag、DoctorWine与Gambero Rosso：2027年版指南的首批获奖者、同时出现在多份榜单上的酒，以及接下来的发布日程。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/guide-vini-2027-premiati.jpg?v=bf21df13" length="289000" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/guide-vini-2027-premiati.jpg?v=bf21df13" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>内比奥罗：意大利最难伺候、也最伟大的葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/nebiaoluo-yidali-zui-nan-de-putao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/nebiaoluo-yidali-zui-nan-de-putao/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>颜色浅淡，单宁凶猛，成熟很晚：从巴罗洛到瓦尔泰利纳，为什么内比奥罗既考验种它的人，也考验喝它的人。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nebbiolo-vitigno-piu-difficile.jpg?v=d8ca6808" length="273522" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nebbiolo-vitigno-piu-difficile.jpg?v=d8ca6808" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>埃特纳：改写意大利葡萄酒版图的火山</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/aitena-gaixie-yidali-putaojiu-bantu-de-huoshan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/aitena-gaixie-yidali-putaojiu-bantu-de-huoshan/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Nerello Mascalese、Carricante、自根老藤与142个contrade：为什么埃特纳是意大利争议最多的产区，神话之外还有什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/etna-vulcano-del-vino.jpg?v=9c59d149" length="136978" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/etna-vulcano-del-vino.jpg?v=9c59d149" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>传统法还是罐内发酵：杯中到底有什么不同</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.05/chuantongfa-haishi-guanneifajiao-beizhong-butong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.05/chuantongfa-haishi-guanneifajiao-beizhong-butong/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>瓶中还是罐中二次发酵，酒泥陈酿的月数，气泡与香气：不摆架子地谈谈弗朗恰柯达（Franciacorta）、特伦托DOC与普罗赛克。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/metodo-classico-charmat.jpg?v=edfe79e1" length="265747" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/metodo-classico-charmat.jpg?v=edfe79e1" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>饮用温度：为什么我们总把红酒白酒弄错</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.04/yinyong-wendu-hongjiu-baijiu-nongcuo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.04/yinyong-wendu-hongjiu-baijiu-nongcuo/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>红酒太热，白酒冰过头：为什么“室温”是个误会，以及各类葡萄酒究竟该几度。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/temperatura-di-servizio.jpg?v=74c07d0c" length="162421" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/temperatura-di-servizio.jpg?v=74c07d0c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>橙酒：像红酒一样酿的白酒（也让餐桌意见分裂）</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.04/chengjiu-xiang-hongjiu-yiyang-niang-de-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.04/chengjiu-xiang-hongjiu-yiyang-niang-de-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>什么是橙酒，为什么它不等于自然酒，从格鲁吉亚陶罐到奥斯拉维亚，以及如何毫无畏惧地搭配餐食。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-orange.jpg?v=10c5f64a" length="264427" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-orange.jpg?v=10c5f64a" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title