="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>要不要醒酒：醒酒器何时有用，何时帮倒忙</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.01/yao-bu-yao-xingjiu-xingjiuqi-heshi-youyong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.01/yao-bu-yao-xingjiu-xingjiuqi-heshi-youyong/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>是去除沉淀，还是给酒氧气？年轻的酒何时该醒，脆弱的老红酒如何保护，白葡萄酒和起泡酒又该怎么办。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/decantare-o-no.jpg?v=b1b27272" length="87133" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/decantare-o-no.jpg?v=b1b27272" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>家里的酒窖：陈年葡萄酒到底需要什么</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.30/jiali-de-jiujiao-chennian-putaojiu-xuyao-shenme/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.30/jiali-de-jiujiao-chennian-putaojiu-xuyao-shenme/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>恒定的温度、湿度、黑暗与安静：在家、酒柜或储藏间里存酒，真正要紧的是什么，哪些酒值得等待。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cantina-in-casa.jpg?v=950a86ed" length="219575" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cantina-in-casa.jpg?v=950a86ed" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>桑娇维塞：一个品种，百副面孔（却没有身份证）</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.30/sangiovese-yige-pinzhong-baifu-miankong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.30/sangiovese-yige-pinzhong-baifu-miankong/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>经典基安蒂、布鲁奈罗、诺比利、莫雷利诺、罗马涅：同一个桑娇维塞为何每座山丘都换一张脸，又为何盲品时能骗过所有人。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sangiovese-cento-volti.jpg?v=ad43ed01" length="321864" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sangiovese-cento-volti.jpg?v=ad43ed01" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Aglianico：被称作“南方巴罗洛”，却不需要皮埃蒙特</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.29/aglianico-nanfang-baroluo-putao-pinzhong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.29/aglianico-nanfang-baroluo-putao-pinzhong/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Taurasi、Vulture与Taburno：为什么Aglianico被叫作“南方巴罗洛”，以及这个绰号为何终究显得太小，装不下这个品种。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aglianico-barolo-del-sud.jpg?v=f0430e62" length="250803" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aglianico-barolo-del-sud.jpg?v=f0430e62" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Verdicchio：比许多红酒更耐陈的白酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/verdicchio-bijiao-hongjiu-geng-naichen-de-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/verdicchio-bijiao-hongjiu-geng-naichen-de-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Castelli di Jesi与Matelica、双耳瓶造型、DOCG Riserva：为什么Verdicchio是真正懂得等待的意大利白酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/verdicchio-bianco-che-invecchia.jpg?v=fe385772" length="300005" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/verdicchio-bianco-che-invecchia.jpg?v=fe385772" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Timorasso：皮埃蒙特忘了自己拥有的那款白酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/timorasso-pimengte-yiwang-de-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/timorasso-pimengte-yiwang-de-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从上世纪八十年代的半公顷到Derthona之名：托尔托纳山丘的Timorasso如何从灭绝边缘归来，以及它今天为何引发争论。</description><enclosure